{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33610","headline":"送徐侍御充南诏判官 · 许棠","name":"送徐侍御充南诏判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西去安夷落，乘轺从节行。\n彤庭传圣旨，异城化戎情。\n瘴路穷巴徼，蛮川过峤城。\n地偏风自杂，天漏月稀明。\n危栈连空动，长江到底清。\n笑宜防狒狒，言好听猩猩。\n抚论如敦行，归情自合盟。\n回期佩印绶，何更见新正。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33610.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33610","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}